AcceptanceCriteria.Criterion:
Each of these named commands exits 0, run as the command
text named, not via bun run validate:ci. Read exit codes
from the command, never through a pipe: bun run typecheck;
bun run test; bun run validate:cli;
bun run ./scripts/validate-marketplace.ts;
bun run validate:examples; bun run validate:determinism;
bun run validate:packed; bun run validate:schema-reference;
bun run validate:skeleton-templates.
validate:teaching-surface is not required. None of these is
a current-mode lint of this root. Do not put
bun run ngrace lint --path . or
bun ./src/grace.ts lint --path . --fail-on warnings in this
task's Verification; that live root 0/0 is CloseEvidence
on AC-CLOSE-LINT, post-archive only.
